{"Title":"An Act making October 25th Dwarfism Awareness Day in the Commonwealth","BillNumber":"S2003","DocketNumber":"SD1145","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"PRF0","Name":"Paul R. Feeney","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PRF0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-12T16:55:29.497"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"PRF0","Name":"Paul R. Feeney","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PRF0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-12T16:55:29.4966667"},{"Id":"PMO","Name":"Patrick M. O'Connor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMO","ResponseDate":"2023-10-23T14:56:09.58"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2003/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Feeney, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2003) of Paul R. Feeney for legislation to make October 25th Dwarfism Awareness Day in the Commonwealth.  State Administration and Regulatory Oversight.","DocumentText":"\tChapter 6 of the General Laws is hereby amended by inserting after section 15LLLLLL the following section:-\r\n\tSection 15MMMMMM. The governor shall annually issue a proclamation setting apart October 25 as National Dwarfism Day and shall recommend that the day be observed in an appropriate manner by the people.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":"Whereas, The deferred operation of this act would tend to defeat its purpose, which is to establish forthwith October 25 as Dwarfism Awareness Day, therefore it is hereby declared to be an emergency law, necessary for the immediate preservation of the public convenience.\r\n\r\n","RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J25","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J25"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}